    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prodix is a 2D isometric factory automation game, where the goal is to import, export, and automate your production of many different materials and items; while also managing company relationships through contracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/15ba1e06298391be36a2dfbbc7f2fafa.poster.avif?t=1752695523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/15ba1e06298391be36a2dfbbc7f2fafa.apng?t=1752695523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relationships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships are a vital key to your success within Prodix. You can accept, reject, and cancel contracts with different companies; each of these actions will either increase or decrease your company relationships\u2014allowing you to produce more, get new technologies, and have an increased selling price for all of your finished products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/14b8d4d1ec1f8e9474098aa545a10a78.poster.avif?t=1752695523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/14b8d4d1ec1f8e9474098aa545a10a78.apng?t=1752695523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=157 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your resources is another important aspect of the game; you can put in buy orders for specific items which will then enter through the import garage gates on the side of your building. But be careful, these buy orders can fluctuate depending on your purchase date, company relationship, and other aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/917381d5486da98950b45866d0735787.poster.avif?t=1752695523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/917381d5486da98950b45866d0735787.apng?t=1752695523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prodix is a 2D isometric factory automation game, where the goal is to import, export, and automate your production of many different materials and items; while also managing company relationships through contracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/15ba1e06298391be36a2dfbbc7f2fafa.poster.avif?t=1752695523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/15ba1e06298391be36a2dfbbc7f2fafa.apng?t=1752695523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relationships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships are a vital key to your success within Prodix. You can accept, reject, and cancel contracts with different companies; each of these actions will either increase or decrease your company relationships\u2014allowing you to produce more, get new technologies, and have an increased selling price for all of your finished products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/14b8d4d1ec1f8e9474098aa545a10a78.poster.avif?t=1752695523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/14b8d4d1ec1f8e9474098aa545a10a78.apng?t=1752695523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=157 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your resources is another important aspect of the game; you can put in buy orders for specific items which will then enter through the import garage gates on the side of your building. But be careful, these buy orders can fluctuate depending on your purchase date, company relationship, and other aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/917381d5486da98950b45866d0735787.poster.avif?t=1752695523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732750/extras/917381d5486da98950b45866d0735787.apng?t=1752695523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
